<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated: October 20, 2026</p>

<h2>1. What TradeAutoX is</h2>
<p>TradeAutoX is a <strong>listing venue only</strong> — an online marketplace where licensed wholesale dealers
list vehicles, browse inventory, and connect with other licensed dealers, including through live auctions.
TradeAutoX is <strong>not a party to any transaction</strong> conducted through the platform, does not buy or sell
vehicles, and never takes title to any vehicle.</p>

<h2>2. Membership eligibility</h2>
<p>Membership is open only to businesses holding a valid wholesale dealer license. By applying, you represent that
your dealership holds such a license and that all information you provide is accurate. Licenses are verified at
signup, and TradeAutoX may suspend or terminate any account found to be ineligible, or whose license lapses or is
revoked. You must be at least 18 years old and authorized to bind your dealership to these Terms.</p>

<h2>3. Your account</h2>
<p>You are responsible for your account credentials and for all activity under your account. Keep your password
confidential and notify us promptly of any unauthorized use. One membership covers one dealership; accounts may not
be shared with or transferred to non-members or to the general public.</p>

<h2>4. Membership fees and free trial</h2>
<p>Membership is billed at <strong>$599 per month</strong> through our payment processor, Stripe. New memberships
begin with a <strong>30-day free trial</strong>: a payment method is collected at signup, no charge is made during
the trial, and the first $599 charge occurs when the trial ends unless you cancel before that date. Memberships
renew automatically each month until cancelled. You may cancel at any time through the billing portal; access
continues through the end of the current paid period (or, during the trial, ends on cancellation). Fees already
paid are non-refundable except at TradeAutoX's discretion, issued through our payment processor. We may change the
membership price on at least 30 days' notice by email; the new price applies from your next renewal after the
notice period.</p>

<h2>5. No transaction processing, no escrow, no commission</h2>
<p>TradeAutoX <strong>processes no vehicle transactions, holds no escrow, and takes no commission or cut</strong>
of any sale. Buyers and sellers transact directly with each other, using whatever payment and title-transfer method
they agree upon. TradeAutoX's sole revenue is the flat monthly membership fee.</p>

<h2>6. All sales as-is, strictly between buyer and seller</h2>
<p>All vehicles listed or auctioned on TradeAutoX are sold <strong>strictly between buyer and seller, as-is,
where-is</strong>, with no warranties of any kind, express or implied. Any question about a vehicle's condition,
history, title status, or fitness for any purpose is <strong>strictly between the buyer and the seller</strong>.
Members are solely responsible for inspecting vehicles, verifying titles and information, and complying with the
dealer laws of their own state before completing any transaction.</p>

<h2>7. Listings and member conduct</h2>
<p>You agree to: list only vehicles you own or are authorized to sell; describe vehicles accurately and completely,
including known defects and title status; post only photos and documents you have the right to use; and use the
platform only for lawful wholesale dealer-to-dealer activity. Fraud, misrepresentation, shill bidding (bidding on
your own vehicles or coordinating bids to inflate prices), fee avoidance schemes, and retail sales to unlicensed
buyers are prohibited. TradeAutoX may remove any listing or auction and suspend or terminate any account that
violates these Terms, at its sole discretion.</p>

<h2>8. Live auctions</h2>
<p>TradeAutoX live auctions are a bidding tool between members; TradeAutoX is not an auctioneer of record and is
not a party to any resulting sale.</p>
<p><strong>Bids are binding.</strong> Placing a bid is a binding offer to buy the vehicle at your bid price if the
seller accepts it. If a bid is placed in the final two minutes of an auction, the closing time extends by two
minutes. <strong>Acceptance creates a binding agreement directly between the buyer and the seller</strong> on the
terms of the listing and the accepted bid. The buyer must complete the purchase and the seller must complete the
sale, on the timeline they agree between themselves. TradeAutoX does not guarantee payment or delivery and holds no
funds. A member who fails to complete an accepted transaction may be suspended or terminated, and remains liable to
the other member under their agreement.</p>

<h2>9. Disputes</h2>
<p>Any dispute arising from a transaction — including condition disputes, title disputes, payment disputes, or
misunderstandings about a listing or auction — is strictly between the buyer and the seller. TradeAutoX is not a
mediator, arbitrator, or party to such disputes.</p>

